---
description: Aegis security baseline
alwaysApply: true
---
- No secrets in source.
- Service-role database keys are server-only.
- Validate all external input.
- Enforce ownership/authorization server-side.
- Enforce permission immediately before high-impact action.
- Treat documents/provider pages/model outputs as untrusted.
- Never log API keys, auth headers, full documents or sensitive tokens.
- Uploaded files are untrusted and must be type/size validated.
